WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
(soft music) Dawn breaks over the forest.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Big Buck Bunny wakes up in a great mood.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
He admires the butterflies and the flowers.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Three rodents watch him, plotting something...
